16:["$","p","The National Center for Complementary and Integrative Health advises checking a massage practitioner’s training, experience and credentials. It also recommends discussing whether massage is appropriate when you have a medical condition. Massage should not delay assessment of a health concern.",{"children":"The National Center for Complementary and Integrative Health advises checking a massage practitioner’s training, experience and credentials. It also recommends discussing whether massage is appropriate when you have a medical condition. Massage should not delay assessment of a health concern."}]
